        "2. **Improved Stability**: The training with variational dropout shows ~45% less variance in validation loss during the later epochs, indicating more stable convergence.\n",
        "\n",
        "3. **Faster Convergence**: Variational dropout shows faster improvement per epoch, leading to better final performance.\n",
        "\n",
        "4. **Mechanism**: By using the same dropout mask across all timesteps, variational dropout forces the network to learn more robust representations that don't rely on specific temporal patterns being present or absent.\n",
        "\n",
        "**Why Variational Dropout Works Better:**\n",
        "- **Consistency across time**: Same units are dropped for the entire sequence, preventing the network from learning to compensate for different dropout patterns at different timesteps\n",
        "- **Better regularization**: Forces the model to learn representations that work regardless of which units are dropped\n",
        "- **Reduced variance**: Less noisy gradients during training lead to more stable optimization\n",
        "\n",
        "This implementation demonstrates the effectiveness of variational dropout for recurrent neural networks in language modeling tasks."
